{"data":[{"id":2014,"slug":"max-level-returner","title":"Max Level Returner","alt_titles":["我独自满级重生","Игрок-одиночка, вернувшийся с последнего уровня","The Max Level Returner","ผู้หวนคืนเลเวลแม็กซ์","Игрок одиночка, вернувшийся с максимальным уровнем","나 혼자 만렙 귀환자","永恆世界歸還者","Единственный вернувшийся с максимальным уровнем","俺一人だけカンストレベル帰還者"],"description":"120 million people have disappeared worldwide.\r\n\r\n[Final Quest Completion Reward: 'Return' Activated]\r\n\r\nFor the first time in 22 years, Yoon Sang-Hyuk cleared the world's worst survival game.\r\nHe, the so-called strongest person among all other players, one who possess all reward items even the ones that no one else could earn, has come back.\r\n\r\n[Return of the Masked Monarch]\r\n\r\nI alone am level 10,000, I alone have all the items, only me!","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/max-level-returner.226ded.webp","status":"dropped","type":"manhwa","author":"Honey (허니)","artist":"Daum","popularity_rank":287,"bookmark_count":1922,"rating":8.115384615384615,"chapter_count":118,"last_chapter_at":"2022-01-01T00:00:00Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T15:41:09.071697Z","public_url":"/comics/max-level-returner-bd5bdaf8","source_url":"/s/2014","genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"id":4,"name":"Adventure","slug":"adventure"},{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":144888,"series_id":0,"number":117,"slug":"0d7c5470-e549-4fa2-8881-dd77f298b740","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2021-10-06T03:41:36Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":144886,"series_id":0,"number":116,"slug":"329be48b-0718-42b0-beaf-95ba16164c2c","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2021-09-27T21:18:48Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":144885,"series_id":0,"number":115,"slug":"3faa7ff5-9613-470d-9f7b-ddaace898fd9","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2021-09-27T21:18:09Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]},{"id":1993,"slug":"mookhyang-the-origin","title":"Mookhyang The Origin","alt_titles":["墨剑留香前传","طریقت موک هیانگ","墨香 THE ORIGIN","มุกฮยาง ดิ ออริจิน","묵향 디 오리진"],"description":"In a world with bloody and vast battlefields where several forces fought for supremacy; a young boy only known as number 2044, was kidnapped and trained to be an assassin by the enemy since he was a child. After much intensive training and struggling through life-threatening situations, he gained the name “Mukhyang”. But Mukhyang was never satisfied, he had an unfulfilled thirst for something, and that was the path of the sword! As Mukhyang was dissatisfied with his life as an assassin, he met his mentor 'Yu Baek of the Hwan Sa Sword' and his life changed forever. Will he be able to reach the pinnacle of martial arts?!\r\n\r\nFighting with geniuses as he climbs his way to the top!","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/mookhyang-the-origin.1f831b.webp","status":"completed","type":"manhwa","author":"Jeon Dongjo","artist":"Redice Studio","popularity_rank":293,"bookmark_count":1505,"rating":8.676470588235293,"chapter_count":48,"last_chapter_at":"2022-01-01T00:00:00Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T15:41:09.071697Z","public_url":"/comics/mookhyang-the-origin-bd5bdaf8","source_url":"/s/1993","genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"id":34,"name":"Murim","slug":"murim"},{"id":55,"name":"Shounen","slug":"shounen"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":141508,"series_id":0,"number":47,"slug":"bae380a7-f8fb-497d-83ac-e4ab409b1d5c","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"published_at":"2021-08-15T21:19:26Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":141506,"series_id":0,"number":46,"slug":"1fa416b5-0802-4141-8fbe-61d8d102f628","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,